// # oodrv-accel Core Filesystem Anchor
//
// Logline: Re-exports the CWE-22 path admission gate, capability-gated filesystem
//   probe, accelerator manifest reader, and kernel state store pages.
// Setup: Pure subsystem anchor shim for oodrv-accel core/fs pages.
// Beats:
//   1. Export the traversal and metacharacter path admission gate.
//   2. Export the FsReadCap probe, manifest reader, and FsWriteCap state store.
//   3. Enforce CWE-22 fail-closed admission on every filesystem operand.
//   4. Route all manifest and state reads through sealed capability handles.
//   5. Separate path validation from accelerator device drivers cleanly.

import "gate.oo";
import "fsprobe.oo";
import "manifest.oo";
import "state.oo";
